f9a47113004ef7","RawContent":"I am wondering if any of you could share the itinerry you provided for your guests so we can steal some of your ideas. We want the schedule to be really flexible but still let people know when we will be available to hang out and\/or carouse over the weekend.\n \n Thanks in advance!","Attachments":[],"Id":10534,"PostDate":1165359088,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am wondering if any of you could share the itinerry you provided for your guests so we can steal some of your ideas. We want the schedule to be really flexible but still let people know when we will be available to hang out and\/or carouse over the weekend.<br \/> <br \/> Thanks in advance!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong><i>Jen & Aaron<br>January 13, 2007<\/i><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jengonda@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1147890000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206735.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":93,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JENGONDA9","Id":206735,"Name":"JENGONDA9","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":961,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLike