{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.150.95.42","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"587578e7c1c1c22960f58c604790c0e9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;You are getting a lot done @[member=\"RandL2015\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since I&#039;m so short, the designer custom made my dress to fit my height but when I had my first fitting I discovered they had cut it too short and they have to remake the skirt which won&#039;t be finished until October and the wedding is in November :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903932,"PostDate":1441118888,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>You are getting a lot done @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271841\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/271841-randl2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RandL2015<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since I'm so short, the designer custom made my dress to fit my height but when I had my first fitting I discovered they had cut it too short and they have to remake the skirt which won't be finished until October and the wedding is in November <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397425622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.194.118.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"085dabc6c6e07bdd781ae89bae0c79f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh No @[member=\"malyna\"]!! &amp;nbsp;I know that is stressful. I&#039;m sure everything will be okay. &amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp;It&#039;s a good thing you didn&#039;t wait until the very last minute. One of my friends was still getting her dress altered 2 days before her wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903952,"PostDate":1441125793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh No @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277580-malyna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">malyna<\/span><\/a>!! \u00a0I know that is stressful. I'm sure everything will be okay. \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0It's a good thing you didn't wait until the very last minute. One of my friends was still getting her dress altered 2 days before her wedding.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.200.253.205","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ca5c3ab806e358c0228ca4c7577c627","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"RandL2015\"] - love everything!!&amp;nbsp; Seems like you have everything under control!!&amp;nbsp; I really need to get organized.&amp;nbsp; That&#039;s this week&#039;s to do - create 1 massive to do list and assign due dates - I do better with structure lol.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where did you get the monogramed tote bags and backpacks and the robes?  &amp;nbsp;I may have to steal some of these ideas!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"malyna\"] - that does suck!&amp;nbsp; But like @[member=\"RandL2015\"] said good thing you caught it early!&amp;nbsp; My dress hasn&#039;t come in yet.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s scheduled to be here 9\/20.&amp;nbsp; Fingers crossed we&#039;re on time.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903956,"PostDate":1441128615,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271841\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/271841-randl2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RandL2015<\/span><\/a> - love everything!!\u00a0 Seems like you have everything under control!!\u00a0 I really need to get organized.\u00a0 That's this week's to do - create 1 massive to do list and assign due dates - I do better with structure lol.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where did you get the monogramed tote bags and backpacks and the robes?\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0I may have to steal some of these ideas!!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277580-malyna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">malyna<\/span><\/a> - that does suck!\u00a0 But like @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"271841\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/271841-randl2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RandL2015<\/span><\/a> said good thing you caught it early!\u00a0 My dress hasn't come in yet.\u00a0 It's scheduled to be here 9\/20.\u00a0 Fingers crossed we're on time.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Daisy<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to marry my best friend \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79500-janjins-planning-thread-azul-sensatori\/?p=1902797'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79500-janjins-planning-thread-azul-sensatori\/?p=1902797<\/a>","Email":"daisy.pitre@gmail.com","IpAddress":"142.255.87.125","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1414946723,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Janjin","Id":280967,"Name":"Janjin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.229.104.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0ea517e23ebf6fa4ef3cee6232c2076","RawContent":"Yeah I&#039;m in the middle of looking for shoes now\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1903966,"PostDate":1441143070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yeah I'm in the middle of looking for shoes now<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397425622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.75.116.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c298905a9cef8d3d4ca8fa80d6d5813a","RawContent":"@Jangin purchased the tote bags from the knot, their wedding shop. They had a sale where they were $9.95 + $4.95 for monograming.  The robes I ordered from DH Gate for $14 each.\n\n\n@[member=\"malyna\"] I am just wearing wedge flip flops. Beachy and comfortable.\n\n\nWill try to get more items done this weekend. \ud83d\ude00","Attachments":[],"Id":1903971,"PostDate":1441150791,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @Jangin purchased the tote bags from the knot, their wedding shop. They had a sale where they were $9.95 + $4.95 for monograming.  The robes I ordered from DH Gate for $14 each.<br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277580\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277580-malyna\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">malyna<\/span><\/a> I am just wearing wedge flip flops. Beachy and comfortable.<br><br>\nWill try to get more items done this weekend. \ud83d\ude00\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.143.121.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf773444b43242c526216911c9b822a4","RawContent":"Ok fellow November 2015 Brides, we have 1 full month of planning, what is everyone doing now?\n\n\nI just had my bridal shower this past Saturday, which was so much fun. Gave out my \"Bridal Entourage \" gift bags which they loved. \n\nPacked 2 suitcases with all of my reception, and party decorations.\n\n\nSubmitted my documents to the resort, and finalized my wedding contract.\n\n\nNow, that I have a final count of 23 guests that will be joining us, I am going to get my OOT bags together.\n\n\nWhew, I feel like it is all coming together.\n","Attachments":[],"Id":1905916,"PostDate":1444014484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok fellow November 2015 Brides, we have 1 full month of planning, what is everyone doing now?<br><br>\nI just had my bridal shower this past Saturday, which was so much fun. Gave out my \"Bridal Entourage \" gift bags which they loved. <br>\nPacked 2 suitcases with all of my reception, and party decorations.<br><br>\nSubmitted my documents to the resort, and finalized my wedding contract.<br><br>\nNow, that I have a final count of 23 guests that will be joining us, I am going to get my OOT bags together.<br><br>\nWhew, I feel like it is all coming together.<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905916]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-40867800-1444028649.jpeg\" title=\"image.jpeg -  131.13KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-40867800-1444028649.jpeg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpeg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905916]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-27365900-1444028755.jpeg\" title=\"image.jpeg -  110.33KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-27365900-1444028755.jpeg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpeg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1905916]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-14895300-1444028772.jpeg\" title=\"image.jpeg -  69.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2015\/post-271841-0-14895300-1444028772.jpeg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpeg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.180.69.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4d2ea785e6257790824b3a3adf83b5a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow! @@RandL2015 Sounds like you are super organized and have everything together! I feel like I should start packing stuff up now too!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My family is throwing us a joint wedding shower this weekend! We are down to 41 days until our wedding and 37 days until we leave for Mexico! Things are coming up so fast now that we are getting so much closer, but I haven&#039;t felt the stress yet... I feel like its coming though! List of things that I still need to do:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Finish program fans&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- print welcome letter&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- choose parent dance song&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- book group excursion&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- get marriage licence&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- pick up dress from alterations&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- bridesmaid&#039;s and groomsmen&#039;s gifts&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- print out MC schedule\/script&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- finalize contract with resort&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- make final payment&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- finish writing vows and thank you speech&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- put together a wedding binder with all info to bring to the resort&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- start packing stuff!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Of course my wedding coordinator at the resort is on holidays until next week so its going to probably get crazy then... she still has to send me the finalized contract, final payment information, etc. Can&#039;t wait until all of the contract stuff is out of the way though, then I can cross all that big stuff off the list.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906018,"PostDate":1444223708,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow! @@RandL2015 Sounds like you are super organized and have everything together! I feel like I should start packing stuff up now too!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My family is throwing us a joint wedding shower this weekend! We are down to 41 days until our wedding and 37 days until we leave for Mexico! Things are coming up so fast now that we are getting so much closer, but I haven't felt the stress yet... I feel like its coming though! List of things that I still need to do:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- Finish program fans<\/p>\n<p>- print welcome letter<\/p>\n<p>- choose parent dance song<\/p>\n<p>- book group excursion<\/p>\n<p>- get marriage licence<\/p>\n<p>- pick up dress from alterations<\/p>\n<p>- bridesmaid's and groomsmen's gifts<\/p>\n<p>- print out MC schedule\/script<\/p>\n<p>- finalize contract with resort<\/p>\n<p>- make final payment<\/p>\n<p>- finish writing vows and thank you speech<\/p>\n<p>- put together a wedding binder with all info to bring to the resort<\/p>\n<p>- start packing stuff!<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>Of course my wedding coordinator at the resort is on holidays until next week so its going to probably get crazy then... she still has to send me the finalized contract, final payment information, etc. Can't wait until all of the contract stuff is out of the way though, then I can cross all that big stuff off the list.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amber_cover@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"64.180.69.208","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428842911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282716.jpg?_r=1428872610","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberc","Id":282716,"Name":"amberc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.69.133.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfaf59d10f240e5930fc3f8c719f427a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"amberc\"] Just wanted to pack some things to get them out of the way. &amp;nbsp;My dining room table is filled with so much wedding stuff. &amp;nbsp;I just needed some space. &amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I too have to finish put together my program fans, and do my pre-boarding letter, that I want send out 3 weeks prior to the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Still trying to think of what group activity to do. I want something that at most is a 1\/2 day excursion. Thinking we may just do a group activity at the resort. Maybe a pool tournament for the guys and beach\/pool volleyball for the ladies.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My Fi is still working on our playlist for the DJ.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just crossing one thing at a time on the HUGE \"Things To Do List\"!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906032,"PostDate":1444238162,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282716\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282716-amberc\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">amberc<\/span><\/a> Just wanted to pack some things to get them out of the way. \u00a0My dining room table is filled with so much wedding stuff. \u00a0I just needed some space. \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I too have to finish put together my program fans, and do my pre-boarding letter, that I want send out 3 weeks prior to the wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Still trying to think of what group activity to do. I want something that at most is a 1\/2 day excursion. Thinking we may just do a group activity at the resort. Maybe a pool tournament for the guys and beach\/pool volleyball for the ladies.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Fi is still working on our playlist for the DJ.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just crossing one thing at a time on the HUGE \"Things To Do List\"!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.180.69.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84637bf57672aedbf915d7ab42d4a355","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;RandL2015 I hear you about having stuff all over the place... I&#039;m excited to have the space back again haha&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Ya I like the idea of doing a group excursion too! We gave the guests an option if they wanted to come with us on a Pirate Booze Cruise which I think will be really fun. We didn&#039;t have it in our budget to pay for everyone which sucks so we just asked people if it was something they wanted to do. Most people wanted to do the excursion so I did a group booking for everyone to make it a bit easier on them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;But... I really like your idea about organizing some sort activity at the resort! I might have to steal that!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906035,"PostDate":1444240279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">RandL2015 I hear you about having stuff all over the place... I'm excited to have the space back again haha<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Ya I like the idea of doing a group excursion too! We gave the guests an option if they wanted to come with us on a Pirate Booze Cruise which I think will be really fun. We didn't have it in our budget to pay for everyone which sucks so we just asked people if it was something they wanted to do. Most people wanted to do the excursion so I did a group booking for everyone to make it a bit easier on them.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">But... I really like your idea about organizing some sort activity at the resort! I might have to steal that!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amber_cover@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"64.180.69.208","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428842911,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282716.jpg?_r=1428872610","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amberc","Id":282716,"Name":"amberc","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":49,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
