587c080e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Haha.... no its not...&amp;nbsp; got a lot of ideas for it just from this site.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845388,"PostDate":1398106167,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Haha.... no its not...\u00a0 got a lot of ideas for it just from this site.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishtb96@aol.com","IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383056867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misbosox","Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.110.21.125","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b852ffaf726782252754049e220187c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We put the information for our travel agent, but we also put pricing for all of the room categories. &amp;nbsp;I wanted our guests to know exactly what the cost was so that if they knew ahead of time.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868717,"PostDate":1408978902,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We put the information for our travel agent, but we also put pricing for all of the room categories. \u00a0I wanted our guests to know exactly what the cost was so that if they knew ahead of time.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicki7985@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.235.184.26","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1405904652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279097.jpg?_r=1408764462","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NickiLynn1116","Id":279097,"Name":"NickiLynn1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.143.69.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2203931ddbd7b63528aea8006a6b5356","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We didn&#039;t do a wedding website so we just included the pricing on our travel agent&#039;s site. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868842,"PostDate":1409000930,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We didn't do a wedding website so we just included the pricing on our travel agent's site. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jolie.vidal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.143.69.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408561857,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BrideToBeJolie","Id":279500,"Name":"BrideToBeJolie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.214.134.14","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23f767c628fb26e0c1eb49eb04fa8c55","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great idea to put standard prices on so guests know roughly what its going to cost before they commit. It shouldn&#039;t be a taboo subject as everyone has to pay.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869053,"PostDate":1409074932,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great idea to put standard prices on so guests know roughly what its going to cost before they commit. It shouldn't be a taboo subject as everyone has to pay.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sportsservicesdirect@gmail.com","IpAddress":"90.214.134.14","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408544191,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lealea","Id":279496,"Name":"lealea","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c09d9e01331083a07d57528834976116","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I put price ranges, gave the TA contact info and listed that TA would match THAT DAY&#039;S rates. We had the tA send out a flier with info as well. Now I don&#039;t have to field questions, I jsut say, \"Hmm, can&#039;t remember, you&#039;ll have to check the website\" haha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869136,"PostDate":1409083514,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I put price ranges, gave the TA contact info and listed that TA would match THAT DAY'S rates. We had the tA send out a flier with info as well. Now I don't have to field questions, I jsut say, \"Hmm, can't remember, you'll have to check the website\" haha<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407354954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.89.250.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cbae30641939d181dad1c1e77f4c667d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@spjwedding&amp;nbsp; lol! I do the same thing with our website. I feel like the should at least look at it before asking me stuff that is clearly addresses. Of course, we have a few people that are older and don&#039;t get online much and I don&#039;t mind them asking me anything. But for the most part everyone is on their smart phones all the time so I dont&#039; see why they can&#039;t check it out!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1871650,"PostDate":1410573119,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@spjwedding\u00a0 lol! I do the same thing with our website. I feel like the should at least look at it before asking me stuff that is clearly addresses. Of course, we have a few people that are older and don't get online much and I don't mind them asking me anything. But for the most part everyone is on their smart phones all the time so I dont' see why they can't check it out!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dm@eawifi.com","IpAddress":"198.89.250.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395189111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"danielleandryan2015","Id":277219,"Name":"danielleandryan2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.234.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f45d88366e2347b57b81063be70b46d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We didn&#039;t put prices on our website, but I did put links of places to look at packages (expedia, orbitz, etc.) so they could get a rough idea that way&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873469,"PostDate":1411764357,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We didn't put prices on our website, but I did put links of places to look at packages (expedia, orbitz, etc.) so they could get a rough idea that way<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morgan.rene1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.153.227","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410365199,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279766.jpg?_r=1410362818","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MorganRene","Id":279766,"Name":"MorganRene","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.239.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2df53dbd3ce6cae31392f18bc6927288","RawContent":"We didn&#039;t put prices. We just put the room categories we blocked and the TA&#039;s info.","Attachments":[],"Id":1873624,"PostDate":1411947239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We didn't put prices. We just put the room categories we blocked and the TA's info. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409094707,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76851,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9090f0c5c7094452262ddb861bb45dff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We put prices on our site, as well as our TA&#039;s info. Our prices were just a few general prices so guests had a ball park figure of costs. Here is a link to our wedding website:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/rcstromberg.wix.com\/rosscelestewedding&#039;&gt;http:\/\/rcstromberg.wix.com\/rosscelestewedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874268,"PostDate":1412479821,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We put prices on our site, as well as our TA's info. Our prices were just a few general prices so guests had a ball park figure of costs. Here is a link to our wedding website:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/rcstromberg.wix.com\/rosscelestewedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/rcstromberg.w...scelestewedding<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410927188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":37,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
