818\"&gt; is still alive and active, but hopefully that thread will be more for brides to discuss their weddings and form a sense of community.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #181818\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #181818\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: #181818\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(24,24,24); font-size: 10pt\"&gt;* edited to add attachment of NOW Jade Resort Pictures&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(24,24,24); font-size: 10pt\"&gt;** Please note, the information in this thread and on BDW has not been verified and is not guaranteed. &amp;nbsp;The resort may change their wedding packages, pricing, details, etc. at any time without giving notice. &lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;This information is just to be used as a guideline and not as a contract of what the resort or BDW guarantees.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt; &amp;nbsp;When you are ready to book and sign a contract with the resort, you will need to rely on the information they have given you.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595151,"PostDate":1331777358,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: 